flowchart TD
    A[Host creates session] --> B[Session in LOBBY]
    B --> C[Host starts session]
    C --> D[current_position = 1]
    D --> E[question_started_at = now]
    E --> F[Host gets question]
    F --> G[Player gets question]
    G --> H[Player answers question]
    H --> I[Server computes elapsed time]
    I --> J[Server computes points]
    J --> K[Server saves answer + score]
    K --> L{All questions answered?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Set completed true]
    L -->|No| N[Host advances question]
    N --> O[current_position++]
    O --> P[question_started_at = now]
    P --> F
    M --> Q[Host closes session]
    Q --> R[ended_at = now]
    R --> S[Game finished]
    S --> T[Hub gets results]